     2051     else do:
     2052       find first in-vatp_doc-attrocur no-lock
     2053         where in-vatp_doc-attrocur.doc-code  = cl_tt-clcparts.out-code
     2054           and in-vatp_doc-attrocur.attr-code = 'envd':U
     2055         no-error .
     2056       if not available in-vatp_doc-attrocur then do:
